n","name":"Upgrade a Station","imageType":"station_large","imageKey":null,"objectives":[{"id":"deliver_4_iron_for_upgrade","text":"Deliver 4 Iron to a planet with a station you’d like to upgrade","done":true},{"id":"upgrade_to_large_station","text":"Upgrade a Station to a Large Station","done":false}],"details":"Stations only allow one train (in low orbit) to load or unload at a time, while a Large Station can accommodate trains in two orbits.","reward":50000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"active","acceptedSd":829.6681904619015,"completedSd":null,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[78,77,79,50020]},{"id":"galactic_distance","name":"Galactic Distance Record","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_passenger","objectives":[{"id":"deliver_15k_au","text":"Deliver any cargo or passengers on a single trip of more than 15,000 SU","done":false}],"details":"Can your trains go the distance? Complete a single cargo delivery trip of more than 15,000 SU — note that this exceeds the maximum range of the Constellation class engine, so a more powerful engine will be required.","reward":30000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"active","acceptedSd":830.2509548790069,"completedSd":null,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[78,77,79,50020]},{"id":"dispose_hazmat","name":"Dispose of Hazmat","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_hazmat","objectives":[{"id":"incinerate_hazmat","text":"Incinerate 2.0 units of Hazmat","done":false}],"details":"Industrial activity produces Hazmat as a by-product. As Hazmat accumulates on a planet, it drags down the planet's productivity & its people's happiness. Pick up Hazmat from a planet with Hazmat cars & transport it to the nearest star for incineration.","reward":8000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"active","acceptedSd":830.7148341531739,"completedSd":null,"ironUnloc